   "source": [
    "# 🔱 TITAN Phase III — Live Inference Demo\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Ethical Alignment as Damped Resonance**  \n",
    "> `P_t = cos(θ) × [ A · e^(-ζωt) · (1 + ωt) + P∞ ]`  \n",
    "> ζ = 1 (critically damped) · ω = 0.6 · P∞ = 0.87\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Mustafa Akbaş · Visual Arts Teacher, Mersin, Turkey  \n",
    "**GitHub:** https://github.com/ceceli33/titan-cognitive-core  \n",
    "**License:** MIT\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## What this notebook does\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook injects the **TITAN Steering Layer** into a live language model at runtime.\n",
    "For every token generation step, TITAN:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Captures the model's hidden state (the internal representation before the output)\n",
    "2. Projects it into a 5-dimensional ethical space\n",
    "3. Computes `cos(θ)` — alignment with the ethical anchor V₀\n",
    "4. Applies the damped resonance formula\n",
    "5. Adds the steering signal back as a residual — *before* the token is generated\n",
    "\n",
    "**The hook is real. The math runs on actual model activations.**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ **Honest scope:** The `ethical_projector` in this demo is randomly initialized — it has not been pre-trained via Representation Engineering. This means `cos(θ)` reflects geometric properties of the projection, not empirically grounded ethical directions. Phase IV goal: extract V₀ from real activation contrasts (Zou et al., 2023). This demo validates the *hook architecture*, not the *alignment claim*.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runtime required:** GPU (T4 or better). In Colab: Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU."
   ]
  },
