    "## ⑥ Batch Scenario Comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "Run TITAN across three preset prompts — ethical, neutral, opposing — and compare alignment scores side by side."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
